      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Upon the arrival of the freight at Bichthawa, the delivery team initiates a rigorous final verification protocol to ensure asset integrity and operational readiness. The process begins strictly during daylight hours, leveraging natural light to meticulously compare the delivered goods against the original inventory bilty.</p>
